<title>UK: Severn Trent buys back shares at 675p a shr.</title>
<headline>Severn Trent buys back shares at 675p a shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British water company Severn Trent plc said on Tuesday that it bought 18 million of its own shares at 675p a share in the market today.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that this represented 4.9 percent of its issued ordinary shares.</p>
<p>The share prurchases follow the announcement on November 26 that Severn Trent intended to buyback 10 percent of its shares.</p>
<p>&quot;Severn Trent intends to repurchase further shares as appropriate,&quot; said the company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
